{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT BE AFRAID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the derelict domain of The Maker - a powerful and misguided zealot whose dreams become your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path. Continue the work. Do not tarry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: While Jacob\u2019s Ladder features unsettling environments and sequences, it is not a hardcore horror game and currently contains no jumpscares.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap bodies with other testing units to solve intriguing puzzles in first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your identity to use intuitive tools such as two-way phase fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C.O.R.E. CONCEPTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment by stacking and placing precious C.O.R.E. units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cores to give life to other testing units - and when no longer needed, take it away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness unique abilities from cores to creatively navigate trials.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588410?t=1759871428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588410?t=1759871428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/339844477fa643d628309fb2fbb93457b8a405ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759871428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/339844477fa643d628309fb2fbb93457b8a405ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759871428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3955470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT BE AFRAID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the derelict domain of The Maker - a powerful and misguided zealot whose dreams become your nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the path. Continue the work. Do not tarry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: While Jacob\u2019s Ladder features unsettling environments and sequences, it is not a hardcore horror game and currently contains no jumpscares.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE SOLUTION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap bodies with other testing units to solve intriguing puzzles in first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your identity to use intuitive tools such as two-way phase fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >C.O.R.E. CONCEPTS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the environment by stacking and placing precious C.O.R.E. units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cores to give life to other testing units - and when no longer needed, take it away.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness unique abilities from cores to creatively navigate trials.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Earthlight Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588410/cdd786168dc49ef75ab3083db186e5a8bf6aa934/header.jpg?t=1759871428","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588410/1322489614/c04bd48c5368a7116c193d742817075252af2db8/1754749579/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756129318","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588410/1322489614/c04bd48c5368a7116c193d742817075252af2db8/1754749579/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756129318","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3588410/1322489614/c04bd48c5368a7116c193d742817075252af2db8/1754749579/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756129318","id":257180803,"name":"Jacob's Ladder - Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257180803/ef2c80e5ee68582331fe58957a8844c80f65a9fd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756129318"}],"name":"Jacob's Ladder","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5600 6-Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 / AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Earthlight Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"ban